Output docs/public/demo/scan.gif
Source scripts/demo/settings.tape
Set Height 900

Hide
Type `cd "$DEMO_DIR" && export PS1='$ ' && clear`
Enter
Show

Type "npx archprint scan ."
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 7s

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "npx archprint explain AP-001 ."
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 6s
